Hello Principal Rogers,<br />
&nbsp;<br />
We are on the home stretch with just about a month left of another successful school year.&nbsp; I am reaching out today to talk about our Pint-size Hero Program and how it might be able to be part of the &lsquo;18-&lsquo;19 school year planning.&nbsp; This program is a wonderful opportunity to teach students about the Red Cross and help achieve the goal of preparing the youth to become future stewards of the community.&nbsp; I look forward to your thoughts and a quick phone call to go over the program in more detail.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
